{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"眼前的好还在，心里先有一点鼻酸（到时出现） / 歌声忽然往上涌，又轻轻呼出一口气（到时出现）\",\n      \"source\": \"S02-B3：第12–14小节，歌声忽然往上涌；第14–16小节，它没有继续冲向高潮，而像轻轻呼出一口气。S02-B4：几次柔软的落音，像一根温柔的刺，眼前的好还在，心里却已经有一点鼻酸。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿先写歌声上涌、回落，再写柔软落音带来的鼻酸；屏幕稿将两段的先后顺序调换了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"screen\": \"高处拉长的声音像夕阳最后一道金光（到时出现）\",\n      \"source\": \"S04-B2：高处的长颤音像夕阳在水面切出的最后一道金光。\",\n      \"type\": \"8\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确写的是长颤音，屏幕稿改成拉长的声音，丢掉了颤音这一具体的声音形态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"screen\": \"要是哪天对方【不再需要他】，【连相处都不自在呢】？\",\n      \"source\": \"S09-1：若对方哪天不再需要他，甚至不愿和他相处呢？\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿担心的是对方甚至不愿意再与他相处，屏幕稿改成相处时感到不自在，改变了担心的具体内容。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f13cfa1a-d556-4b9f-8856-4633da619f59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T014948532499Z", "elapsed_seconds": 153.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:52:21.923101+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1b710c07b1eec8ed16ec65e7ad850e449d225c15a54f06c2fa194e12d693da2a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http